    "zh": "新规从第 3 天生效。一个区域的所有有效读数都达到 24°C，才能列入恒温区验收名单。交出每个入选区域在验收期间的最冷读数，最冷读数较高的区域排在前面，同温度按区域名升序。",
    "en": "The new rule starts on day 3. An area qualifies only if every valid reading from that point is at least 24°C. Report the coldest reading for each qualified area. Put higher minimums first, with ties by area name ascending."
  },
